#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key used to encrypt stored API tokens. It must be readable by the web server and poller users and not world-readable. When the file is missing, only token files can be used."
msgstr "Njia kamili ya ufunguo wa baiti 32 unaotumika kusimba tokeni za API zilizohifadhiwa. Ni lazima uweze kusomwa na watumiaji wa seva ya wavuti na poller na usiweze kusomwa na mtu yeyote. Faili inapokosekana, faili za tokeni pekee ndizo zinaweza kutumika."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Token File Directory"
msgstr "Saraka ya Faili ya Tokeni"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Absolute path of the directory that every account token file must be in. When empty, a token file may be anywhere the web server and poller users can read."
msgstr "Njia kamili ya saraka ambayo kila faili ya tokeni ya akaunti lazima iwemo. Inapokuwa tupu, faili ya tokeni inaweza kuwa mahali popote ambapo watumiaji wa seva ya wavuti na poller wanaweza kuisoma."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Interactive Request Timeout"
msgstr "Muda wa Mwisho wa Ombi la Moja kwa Moja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Total time in seconds allowed for a Cloudflare API request made from the web interface, such as Verify."
msgstr "Jumla ya muda kwa sekunde unaoruhusiwa kwa ombi la API ya Cloudflare linalofanywa kutoka kiolesura cha wavuti, kama vile Thibitisha."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Request Timeout"
msgstr "Muda wa Mwisho wa Ombi la Mkusanyaji"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Total time in seconds allowed for a Cloudflare API request made by the background collector."
msgstr "Jumla ya muda kwa sekunde unaoruhusiwa kwa ombi la API ya Cloudflare linalofanywa na mkusanyaji wa chinichini."

